## 📊 Business Analytics

The project generates multiple analytical reports using SQL.

### Customer Revenue Report

Calculates total revenue generated by each customer.

### Branch Revenue Report

Calculates total revenue generated by each branch.

### Product Revenue Report

Calculates total revenue generated by each product.

### Monthly Revenue Report

Calculates revenue aggregated by month.

### Highest Revenue Customer

Identifies the customer generating the highest revenue.

### Highest Revenue Branch

Identifies the branch generating the highest revenue.

### Top Five Products

Ranks products based on their generated revenue.

### Customer Purchase Frequency

Counts the number of sales transactions made by each customer.

### Running Revenue

Uses a SQL window function to calculate cumulative revenue over time.

### Customer Ranking

Uses the `RANK()` window function to rank customers according to their total revenue.

