## 👁️ Views

### Customer Revenue View

A View named:

```text
CUSTOMER_REVENUE
```

was created to provide customer-level revenue information.

### Branch Revenue Materialized View

A Materialized View named:

```text
BRANCH_REVENUE
```

was created using the `SALES` table to store branch-level revenue aggregation.

The branch details can then be combined with the materialized view using the `BRANCHES` table.

